Fitted: an office floor, from shell to work (Exploded Teardown style)

Picture, models, score and sound effects: made in code for this film. The office, its furniture and its people are
models built from published ergonomic dimension ranges (see FACTS.md); no third-party 3D models are used.

Fonts
- Inter, by Rasmus Andersson and the Inter project authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-inter.txt). https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/inter
- JetBrains Mono, by JetBrains. SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-jetbrainsmono.txt). https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/jetbrainsmono

Lighting
- "Photo Studio Loft Hall" HDRI, Poly Haven. CC0. https://polyhaven.com/a/photo_studio_loft_hall

Music samples (CC0)
- FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org)
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios)
- Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)

Voice
- Narration synthesised with Kokoro (kokoro-onnx, model kokoro-v1.0), voice bf_emma. Apache License 2.0. https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx
- Narration checked with faster-whisper (model small.en). MIT. https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper

Software
- three.js r170. MIT. https://threejs.org
- FFmpeg, used to encode and master the film. LGPL/GPL.

Sources for the numbers on screen: FACTS.md.
